      "content": "thanks but it doesnt feel like a \"transition\". it feels like a burial. like everyone is just waiting for me to realize that there's nothing left inside to save. honestly, it's easier to just accept that the person who actually lived is dead. there's no point in keeping up the charade when the real me is already gone.",
