      "content": "it’s more than just being \"broken\" though. it's like there's no substance left at all. i look at my life and i don't even see a person anymore, just an empty shell that people used to like. it feels selfish to keep taking up space when the version of me that was worth something is already dead. i just feel like a mistake that keeps happening over and over again.",
